@page "/"

<PageTitle>One Big Team | HR Software for Growing SME Teams</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="One Big Team is HR software built for SME HR teams — manage the whole employee lifecycle from onboarding to offboarding, track sickness and absence trends, run recruitment and keep records in one shared workspace.">
</HeadContent>

<SiteHeader CurrentPage="home" />

<main id="home">
  <section class="hero section-band">
    <div class="section-inner hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>HR software built for growing SME teams — from hire to leaver.</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          One Big Team brings employee records, leave, sickness tracking, recruitment,
          onboarding and offboarding into one shared workspace — so SME HR teams spend
          less time chasing paperwork across email and spreadsheets, and more time
          supporting their people.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/signup">Start free trial</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary button-large" href="#watch">Watch the product video</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-shot-figure">
        <div class="image-placeholder hero-shot">
          <img src="/assets/dashboard_hr.png"
               alt="One Big Team dashboard showing employee headcount, upcoming leave and pending approvals at a glance"
               width="1905" height="1362" loading="eager" />
        </div>
        <figcaption>Your team's employee records, leave and approvals in one dashboard.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="features" class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Everything your HR team needs to stay organised.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href="/features/employee-management">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="users" /></span>
          <h3>Employee records</h3>
          <p>Keep employee details, roles and key documents in one dependable place.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/features/leave-management">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="calendar-days" /></span>
          <h3>Leave management</h3>
          <p>Give teams a clear way to request, review and track time away from work.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/features/sickness-absence">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="heart-pulse" /></span>
          <h3>Sickness tracking</h3>
          <p>Record absences consistently and see Bradford Factor trends, so patterns surface before they become a problem.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/features/recruitment">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="user-plus" /></span>
          <h3>Recruitment</h3>
          <p>Track candidates, hiring stages and role progress from first contact to offer.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/features/company-documents">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="folder-open" /></span>
          <h3>Company documents</h3>
          <p>Store policies, templates and shared files where employees can find them.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/features/workflows-reminders">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="diagram-project" /></span>
          <h3>Workflows and reminders</h3>
          <p>Onboarding checklists, probation review scheduling and offboarding workflows keep every stage of employment moving, without relying on memory.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/features/reporting">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="chart-line" /></span>
          <h3>Reporting</h3>
          <p>Understand headcount, leave, sickness and recruitment activity at a glance.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="arrow-right" /></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner two-column">
      <div>
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Why One Big Team?</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-grid">
          <div>
            <strong>The whole employee lifecycle, one workspace</strong>
            <p>Hire-to-leaver moves through one system — with a full audit trail instead of scattered emails.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Absence insight, not just logging</strong>
            <p>Built-in Bradford Factor scoring and absence trends help managers spot patterns early and step in with real context, not guesswork.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Ready for growth</strong>
            <p>Every plan includes every feature, so HR stays consistent as your team expands, restructures or hires more often.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="image-placeholder is-portrait">
        <span class="image-placeholder-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon Name="image" /></span>
        <span class="image-placeholder-label">Photo: HR admin using One Big Team</span>
        <span class="image-placeholder-spec">Real photography, warm natural light, laptop visible on screen, no stock-look poses</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="watch" class="section">
    <div class="section-inner two-column">
      <div>
        <h2>See it work before you sign up.</h2>
        <p>
          No sales call to book. A full walkthrough of employee records, leave,
          recruitment and reporting — watch it whenever suits you, then start
          your own free trial straight after.
        </p>
      </div>
      <VideoCard Title="One Big Team product overview"
                 Caption="A full walkthrough of employee records, leave, recruitment and reporting." />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Set up your HR workspace in four clear steps.</h2>
      </div>

      <ol class="timeline-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="timeline-step-index">1</span>
          <div class="timeline-step-body">
            <h3>Create your company</h3>
            <p>Start with your business profile and the basics your HR system needs.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="timeline-step-index">2</span>
          <div class="timeline-step-body">
            <h3>Import your organisation</h3>
            <p>Add active employees so pricing and team structure can be confirmed.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="timeline-step-index">3</span>
          <div class="timeline-step-body">
            <h3>Configure your HR settings</h3>
            <p>Set leave rules, document areas, workflows and reminder preferences.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="timeline-step-index">4</span>
          <div class="timeline-step-body">
            <h3>Invite your team</h3>
            <p>Bring managers and employees into a workspace built for everyday use.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing" class="section pricing-teaser">
    <div class="section-inner pricing-panel">
      <div>
        <h2>Simple pricing based on active employee count.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Use our pricing calculator to estimate your monthly price before you sign up —
          no need to import any employee data first. Once you're set up, your billing
          automatically reflects your active employee count, so the plan always matches
          the team you actually manage.
        </p>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/pricing#calculator">Try the pricing calculator</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section final-cta">
    <div class="section-inner cta-panel">
      <h2>Bring your people processes together with One Big Team.</h2>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/signup">Start free trial</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<SiteFooter />
